# Force the Netlify-supplied subdomain to redirect to the custom
# domain so bookmarks, old share links, and stray traffic all land
# on a single canonical URL. The `!` forces the redirect even when
# a static file or function would otherwise serve the request.
#
# Lives in static/_redirects (not netlify.toml) because the
# SvelteKit Netlify adapter blocks netlify.toml redirects with the
# error "Redirects are not supported in netlify.toml. Use
# _redirects instead."
https://rehearsal-block.netlify.app/* https://rehearsalblock.com/:splat 301!
